<title>GERMANY: Buba - extended M3 grew annualised 3 pct over 6 mths.</title>
<headline>Buba - extended M3 grew annualised 3 pct over 6 mths.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Thursday its extended M3 money supply aggregate -- which includes domestic non-bank investments in money market funds -- grew at an annualised rate of three percent in the six months June through November.</p>
<p>That growth rate is 2.5 percentage points slower than the six-months annualised growth in standard M3 over the same period, the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
